  "description": "Subject: Request to provision SSL certificate for myapp.example.com  \n\nHi Team,  \n\nPlease provision an SSL certificate for the primary domain **myapp.example.com**. The certificate should also cover the SAN entries **www.myapp.example.com** and **api.myapp.example.com**. Use the idempotency token **f3b9c6e2-8d1a-4c5e-9f7a-1b2c3d4e5f6a** to ensure the request is processed only once. For domain validation, apply the DNS method for the primary domain (myapp.example.com) and the EMAIL method for the www sub\u2011domain (www.myapp.example.com).  \n\nThank you."
